 of the reserve list which  leads to recruitment  and in this presentation i will give you  some insights again  in these different steps  everything starts with the creation of  an epso account so if you do not have  one yet you can create one on our  website  i just remind you that you can only have  one epso account for all your epso  applications do not create new accounts  for new competitions that you want to  take part in  you can then apply through our website  of course and you can't fill in or you  have to fill it fill in  the application form  within the deadline  deadline is 24th of may midday brussels  time  and you can  fill out your application in any of the  24 official eu languages  everybody who applies will be invited to  the first stage of testing which is a  set of multiple choice questions  first we test your reasoning skills your  verbal numerical and abstract reasoning  skills  and then we also test your language  comprehension  in your language one and two  and you see in this frame here the  number of questions you get the time  allocated to solve these questions and  the points you can  win  with these questions  as you can see you need to have a  combined pass mark for your reasoning  skills tests  and you need at least 7 out of 12 for  each of your language comprehension  tests  a language comprehension test is a test  to  assess your linguistic abilities  in terms of vocabulary grammar syntax  syntax and style of a text  in the link or on the link through the  link on this slide you will find sample  tests for all of this so please do  have a look at these reasoning skills  and language comprehension tests that we  make available on this page  because by training this by rehearsing  this  your results will improve you will get  better at performing  when you see the real test by having a  look at these sample tests they are  available in all languages  the best ones after testing stage one  will be invited to testing stage two and  there we first test your general  competencies you see seven competencies  being tested  through two different tests  the case study is a written exercise  we'll test four competencies you see  them listed here  and then an interview will test  three more general competencies  for each competency you can gain up to  10 points  and you need again at least a combined  pass mark of 35 out of 70. okay  after testing these general competencies  you will also have to sit a test to  test your field related competency and  for this competition we  have designed a test which we call  finalization of a text  which basically means that you will be  given  a source text  in  language two so either english or french  you're  choosing and then you will get the  translation of the of that text and this  text will contain mistakes  uh both in formatting and in language  and then of course the candidate has to  detect and correct  the mistakes in the text so that it  matches the source text of course all  right  as you can see this is quite a heavy  test it lasts one hour and you can gain  up to 100 points which are of course  very important to make it to the list of  successful candidates so the people  having the highest marks on both the  field-related competency and the general  competencies  will be listed on the list of successful  candidates  which is the basis for recruitment and  in this slide you see the number of  people that we are selecting for each of  the languages  the next step is then recruitment  uh the recruiting bodies will search  this list when they have vacancies and  offer jobs to the people on the list  the objective is to recruit everybody in  the year to come now the initial  validity of the reserve list is three  years  so not everybody of course will be  offered a job straight after publication  of this list some people will have to  wait a little longer  if you have more questions on this  i advise you to read very carefully the  notice of competition which is the legal  document very extensive document  explaining you all these steps much more  in detail than what i've shared with you  now  if you would still have questions you  can always reach out to us through our  contact form on the website  so and you can also follow us on  facebook and linkedin twitter and  instagram of course to keep or to stay  updated on news that we have on this and  other competitions  also check out the other videos  available on this youtube channel you'll  find out much more on different profiles  we select star for you'll find  testimonials of people currently working  in different positions in the  institutions  so  this is what i want to share with you  about this competition  good luck to the ones who want to apply  and hopefully i see you next  in a following video bye
 

